"P1571061442" "Ranged, High DMG(Lethal), DoT(Toxic), Immobilize, -DEF, -SPD, -Fly, -Jump"
// Power Help Text :
"P1442888553" "You can throw a small cluster of large Thorns at a targeted foe. This Thorn carries a large amount of the toxin. In addition to dealing Toxic damage, a successful attack can slow a target, preventing them from Running, Jumping of Flying.  Most foes will likely be completely Immobilize, unable to run. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Moderate"
