// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2198827565" "Ranged (Cone), Moderate DMG(Negative/Smash), Foe Immobilize, -To-hit"
// Power Help Text :
"P3096869253" "You can create a cone shaped rift to the Netherworld that allows its native creatures to slip their oily Tentacles into our reality. These creatures will snare all foes within range, Immobilizing them while the Tentacles drain their life and reduce their chance to hit. Damage: Moderate(DoT)Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P25083028" "Immobilize, -To-hit"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2600012039" "The Tenebrous Tentacles are holding you immobile and reducing your chance to hit."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
// Effect VictimHit Message :
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1852627711" "Your {PowerName} entangles {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of negative energy damage and reduces their chance to hit!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3880016683" "{PowerName} entangles you for {Damage} points of negative energy damage and reduces your chance to hit!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P362106426" "You Immobilized {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName}!"
